<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN CRICKET BOARD XI V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN CRICKET BOARD XI V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>second day of the three-day match between a Pakistan Cricket</p>
<p>Board (PCB) XI and New Zealand on Monday:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 171 (B.Young 47; Mohammad Zahid</p>
<p>6-54)</p>
<p>PCB XI first innings (overnight 32-2)</p>
<p> Shadab Kabir b Morrison			   7</p>
<p> Zahoor Elahi c Doull b Hart		    34</p>
<p> Mohammad Hussain c Spearman b Morrison	0</p>
<p> Sohail Jaffar lbw b Doull			30</p>
<p> Mahmood Hamid c Fleming b Vaughan	    39</p>
<p> Mohammad Wasim lbw b Doull			6</p>
<p> Ahmer Saeed c subs b Hart			33</p>
<p> Majid Inayat not out			     19</p>
<p> Aqib Javed not out				 23</p>
<p> Extras (lb-2)					 2</p>
<p> Total (for seven wickets, declared)	 193</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-29 2-29 3-55 4-85 5-97 6-142 7-158</p>
<p>Did not bat: Murtaza Hussain, Mohammad Zahid.</p>
<p>Bowling: Doull 13-2-45-2, Morrison 11-3-39-2, Hart</p>
<p>22-6-58-2, Larsen 11-3-33-0, Vaughan 6-1-11-1, Spearman</p>
<p>1-0-5-0.</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings</p>
<p> C.Spearman c Zahoor Elahi b Aqib Javed	1</p>
<p> J.Vaughan not out				  20</p>
<p> B.Young not out				    12</p>
<p> Extras (nb-1)					 1</p>
<p> Total (for one wicket)			   34</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-6</p>
<p>Bowling todate: Aqib Javed 5-3-3-1, Mohammad Zahid 5-0-13-0</p>
<p>(nb1), Mohammad Hussain 5-3-6-0, Murtaza Hussain 5-1-12-0.</p>
